\section{Scope, environment and reproducibility}
% ======================================================================================

All code is pure Python (PyTorch, Hugging Face \texttt{transformers}, NumPy, pandas,
SciPy, Matplotlib) and was executed on the departmental \texttt{bionlp} server with one
A100--40\,GB GPU (CUDA 12, PyTorch 2.x, Python 3.11, conda environment \texttt{a3}).
Each question has its own directory with the scripts, a \texttt{results/} directory of
CSV/JSON artefacts and a \texttt{figures/} directory. The run is deterministic given the
fixed seeds recorded in the source files (Q1 sampling seeds 1000--1002, data/training
seed 42). Model revisions are recorded with every generated response. Table~\ref{tab:files}
