\toprule
Short name & Hugging Face identifier & Parameters & Role \\
\midrule
Qwen2.5-7B & \texttt{Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct} & 7.6B & primary model \\
Mistral-7B & \texttt{mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3} & 7.2B & independent family \\
Phi-3.5-mini & \texttt{microsoft/Phi-3.5-mini-instruct} & 3.8B & small strong model \\
Qwen2.5-1.5B & \texttt{Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct} & 1.5B & scale probe \\
\bottomrule
